# Cline Rules for AI Agent

You must follow these rules without exception.

1. Read `docs/AIDLC.md` to understand your workflow.
2. Read `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md` to see the work done by previous agents.
3. Write clean, modular code.
4. Run tests and verify the build as specified in `docs/TESTING_GUIDE.md` before claiming success.
5. Always log your changes in `docs/CHANGELOG_AI.md` when completing a task.
